5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure the project has the human support it needs, I shall look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited to help! I want to see where the money actually goes these days, so I'll pick travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national computing agreement and facility day rates!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it would be helpful to see what actually happened with past projects. I'll look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not interested in the easy stuff. I want to know what actually stops the work from getting done. I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the current state of our shared infrastructure. I'll look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. By covering both the human element and the physical infrastructure, we shall leave very little to chance. Does anyone feel we have missed a critical angle?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I think we've got it all covered! We're looking at people, money, machines, and history. It's like a big puzzle! @Takumi, do you think there's anything else that could sneak up on us?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Sakura. I think we have a good balance. I just hope the data from the past projects gives us a clear enough signal to make the right choice.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, we've got the basics, but the real trouble usually hides in the gaps. If the logs and records show a pattern of failure, that's what we need to worry about. Let's just get the data.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have a logical distribution of tasks. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can analyze the facts and make an informed decision.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I am content with our arrangement. It is often in the quiet observation of these details that the wisest path reveals itself. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! I can't wait to see what's hiding in those ledgers! It's going to be like a treasure hunt for the truth! @Minako, I bet your infrastructure search will find something super interesting!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope so too. I'll do my best to be thorough with the files. I just want to make sure we don't repeat the same mistakes as before.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Enough talking. We've picked our lists and we know why we're doing it. Let's just stop wasting time and see what the records actually say.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I agree with Takumi. We have established our roles and the scope of our research. There is no further need for deliberation until the data is in our hands.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Then we are in agreement. Let us move forward with a spirit of cooperation and curiosity. I shall await the findings of our collective inquiry.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
